theorem PC9QB4_cert_full : ∀ x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7 : ℝ, 0 ≤ x0 → 0 ≤ x1 → 0 ≤ x2 → 0 ≤ x3 → 0 ≤ x4 → 0 ≤ x5 → 0 ≤ x6 → 0 ≤ x7 →
