  intro x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x6 x7 h0 h1 h2 h3 h4 h5 h6 h7
  rcases lt_or_ge x7 x0 with hlt | hle
  · rcases PC9QB4_half x7 x6 x5 x4 x3 x2 x1 x0 h7 h6 h5 h4 h3 h2 h1 h0 with h | h
    · rw [← PC9QB4_G_rev]; exact h
